Hi Good evening , in todays's class we learned about apache kafka
kafka is a distributed streaming platform. it is used to transfer data from one application to another in real time.

if i explain it with an example.

suppose we are using cab booking application it can be ola, uber , rapoido etc

When we as a customer book a cab then many activity happens at a same time. for example, finding nearby drivers, updating driver location, sending notifications regarding cab booking and tracking the ride.

now , instead of these applcations making communications directly with eachother. we can use kafka to transfer information between them in real time.

if i talk about components of Kafka.

first is Producer that is service to use send massages to kafka. like if a customer book a cab, the cab booking application send the ride details to kafka.

Second is Topic that is like a cotegory where massages are store. for example we can create topic of ride details to store all ride details informarion.
